An escaped row closer stays in an open code span

```
|`\|
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td><code>\|</code></td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| a | ``b\|
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td><code>b\|</code></td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| a `b |
+ c\|
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a <code>b c\|</code></td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```
